 ["A",2,"A mobile network gives every customer who tops up MVR 100 in Ramadan a chance to win a motorbike in a lucky draw. Which promotion tool is this?",["A sweepstake","A premium","A price pack","A patronage reward"],"Sweepstakes ask people to enter a draw for a chance to win.","2026-10-21T19:56:00+05:00"]
